<ArticleLayout
  title="Flu vs. Pneumonia — Warning Signs & Key Differences"
  description="Pneumonia can be a primary infection or a dangerous flu complication. Learn the key differences, warning signs, when a chest X-ray is needed, and how to recognize deterioration."
  publishDate="July 2026"
